# NOTE: do NOT ignore the gate suites' .gate-probe-* files. The checker enumerates
# with `git ls-files --cached --others --exclude-standard`, so ignoring them would
# hide the probes from the very scan they exist to exercise (PR #51: adding this
# ignore turned the mutation assertion red immediately — fail-closed, but broken).
# Collisions between concurrent runs are avoided by PID-scoped probe names instead.
